# Cyber Sentinel AI
**Intelligent Threat Detection. Safer Digital Decisions.**

Streamlit cybersecurity dashboard for IPs, domains and URLs using optional VirusTotal, AbuseIPDB, URLScan and Gemini evidence interpretation.

## Structure
```text
cyber-sentinel-ai/
├── app.py
├── threat_sources.py
├── requirements.txt
├── README.md
├── .gitignore
└── assets/
    └── logo.png
```

## Run locally
```bash
pip install -r requirements.txt
streamlit run app.py
```

## Streamlit Secrets
```toml
GEMINI_API_KEY = "..."
VIRUSTOTAL_API_KEY = "..."
ABUSEIPDB_API_KEY = "..."
URLSCAN_API_KEY = "..."
URLSCAN_VISIBILITY = "unlisted"
```
Never commit API keys or `.streamlit/secrets.toml`.

## Disclaimer
External intelligence may be incomplete or unavailable. Do not submit credentials, tokens, private URLs or sensitive data. URLScan submissions share URLs with URLScan.
